Removed SCEPTRE-compatible Structured Text logic generation. The ``sceptre_plc_compatible_st_logic`` configuration option and the ``sceptre`` parameter of :meth:`~peat.parsing.tc6.TC6.generate_xml_string` and :meth:`~peat.parsing.tc6.TC6.generate_st` no longer exist, and M340 logic output no longer converts ``INT`` variables to ``REAL``. The SCEPTRE field device module is unaffected.
